        // The rule: payoffType and data must match exactly, payoffDirection must match the original.
        // The mutant changes payoffDirection to PayoffDefinitionLib.PayoffDirection(1).
        // So assert that returned.payoffType == initDef.payoffType AND returned.data == initDef.data
