                targetRate: PackedFixed18.wrap(0.5e18),
                targetUtilization: PackedUFixed18.wrap(0.8e18)
            })
        });

        // The caller of initialize must be the Controller, which is checked as contract, so we need a mock Controller
        // We deploy a minimal Controller mock that can satisfy the initialization checks (isContract, owner, etc.)
        ControllerMock controllerMock = new ControllerMock(oracle);

        vm.prank(address(controllerMock));
        c.initialize(info);

        // Now read the payoffDefinition from the reference contract
        PayoffDefinition memory storedDef = c.payoffDefinition();

